<title>POLAND: POLISH BANK HANDLOWY SELLS PLN 7 MLN FORD CPS.</title>
<headline>POLISH BANK HANDLOWY SELLS PLN 7 MLN FORD CPS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's Bank Handlowy SA on Wednesday sold 5.5 million zlotys of commercial paper maturing on March 6, 1997 for Ford Credit Europe plc, a unit of Ford Motor Co. , at an average yield of 19.29 percent, it said.</p>
<p>Handlowy also said in a statement that it sold 1.5 million zlotys of Ford Credit Europe's paper maturing on February 6, 1997 at an average yield of 19.38 percent.</p>
<p>The offering was a part of Ford's 200-million-zloty borrowing programme.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
